                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                    sling:resourceType="core/franklin/components/block/v1/block"
                    aueComponentId="richtext"
                    model="richtext-block"
                    modelFields="[overline@text,heading@text,lead@text,text@richtext,sidebarTitle@text,sidebarText@richtext,ctaUrl@aem-content,ctaText@text]"
                    name="Richtext"
                    overline="Our Story"
                    heading="From Enterprise IT to AI-First Experiences"
                    lead="We didn&apos;t set out to build another CMS. We set out to solve the most important challenge facing every organization: how to deliver experiences that actually matter to people, at scale."
                    text="&lt;p&gt;Zensar Technologies has been at the forefront of enterprise digital transformation since 1991. Over three decades, we&apos;ve worked with Fortune 500 companies, global banks, healthcare systems, and government bodies &#8212; helping them navigate each wave of digital change.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;When AI began reshaping every industry, we recognized a gap: existing digital experience platforms weren&apos;t built for the intelligence era. They were built for the web era &#8212; static, expensive to deploy, and bolted-on AI at best.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;The ZensAI Vision&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;In 2022, Zensar established ZensAI as a dedicated AI innovation lab with a single mission: build the world&apos;s first truly AI-native Digital Experience Platform. Not a CMS with AI features sprinkled on top &#8212; but a platform where intelligence is the foundation, not an afterthought.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;DXP AI launched in 2024, and in its first year it has been adopted by 500+ enterprise organizations across banking, retail, healthcare, manufacturing, and government sectors globally.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Zensar Technologies&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Zensar Technologies Ltd. (NSE: ZENSARTECH) is a leading digital solutions and technology services company, part of the RPG Group. Headquartered in Pune, India, Zensar has 10,000+ professionals across 30+ global offices and serves 200+ clients in 30+ countries.&lt;/p&gt;"
                    sidebarTitle="Join Our Team"
                    sidebarText="&lt;p&gt;We&apos;re building the future of AI-powered digital experiences. Come work on hard problems with a world-class team.&lt;/p&gt;"
                    ctaUrl="/content/my-dxp-site/contact"
                    ctaText="View Open Roles"/>
            </section_2>
